 Horowitz to Blackrock, and Fidelity, and employs a team of 450 engineers and entrepreneurs. Astranis designs, builds, and operates its satellites out of its 153,000 sq. ft. headquarters in Northern California, USA.","metadata_document":"Astranis is a Y Combinator company. It participated in the Winter 2016 batch, in 2016. Its status is active. Its stage is growth. Y Combinator lists its industry as Industrials. Its sub-industry is Industrials within Aviation and Space. Additional listed industries: Aviation and Space. Y Combinator source tags: Space Exploration, Satellites. It is located in San Francisco, CA, USA. Listed regions: United States of America, America / Canada. Its team size is 500. It is currently hiring. It launched in 2015.","name":"Astranis","neighbors":{"combined":[{"id":"ycoss:32233","score":0.6717,"shared_metadata":["yc tag: Space Exploration","yc tag: Satellites","subindustry: Industrials -> Aviation and Space","industry: Industrials"]},{"id":"ycoss:31212","score":0.6633},{"id":"ycoss:24531","score":0.6549,"shared_metadata":["yc tag: Space Exploration","subindustry: Industrials -> Aviation and Space","industry: Industrials"]},{"id":"ycoss:22630","score":0.6457,"shared_metadata":["yc tag: Satellites","subindustry: Industrials -> Aviation and Space","industry: Industrials"]},{"id":"ycoss:29808","score":0.645,"shared_metadata":["yc tag: Satellites","subindustry: Industrials -> Aviation and Space","industry: Industrials"]},{"id":"ycoss:30293","score":0.636,"shared_metadata":["subindustry: Industrials -> Aviation and Space","industry: Industrials"]},{"id":"ycoss:31209","score":0.6261,"shared_metadata":["subindustry: Industrials -> Aviation and Space","industry: Industrials"]},{"id":"ycoss:12877","score":0.6216,"shared_metadata":["yc tag: Space Exploration","subindustry: Industrials -> Aviation and Space","industry: Industrials"]},{"id":"ycoss:27960","score":0.6198,"shared_metadata":["yc tag: Satellites","subindustry: Industrials -> Aviation and Space